WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.078 --> 00:00:22.890
Peter jumped out of the watering can.

2
00:00:22.891 --> 00:00:32.214
"Hey!" cried the farmer.

3
00:00:32.215 --> 00:00:40.681
Peter ran and ran.

4
00:00:40.682 --> 00:00:49.566
Finally the farmer stopped chasing him.

5
00:00:49.567 --> 00:00:54.049
Now Peter was lost.

6
00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:57.855
"Where's the gate?" he asked a mouse.

7
00:00:57.856 --> 00:01:10.176
But the mouse ran away.

8
00:01:10.177 --> 00:01:15.614
Suddenly Peter gasped. "A cat!"

9
00:01:15.615 --> 00:01:19.928
The cat was watching fish in the pond.

10
00:01:19.929 --> 00:01:23.961
She didn't see Peter.

11
00:01:23.962 --> 00:01:27.235
"Whew!" whispered Peter.

12
00:01:27.236 --> 00:01:34.267
He quietly slipped away.

13
00:01:34.268 --> 00:01:39.546
"I must find the gate!" said Peter.

14
00:01:39.547 --> 00:01:42.123
Scritch, scratch!

15
00:01:42.124 --> 00:01:46.491
Peter heard a noise.

16
00:01:46.492 --> 00:01:51.278
He climbed onto a wheelbarrow to see.

17
00:01:51.279 --> 00:01:55.366
The farmer was working in the onion patch.

18
00:01:55.367 --> 00:02:00.001
Scritch, scratch!

19
00:02:00.002 --> 00:02:05.611
Then Peter saw something else.

20
00:02:05.612 --> 00:02:11.284
"The gate!" he cried.

21
00:02:11.285 --> 00:02:17.794
Peter shot across the garden.

22
00:02:17.795 --> 00:02:22.198
The farmer chased him. "Stop, rabbit!"

23
00:02:22.199 --> 00:02:24.824
But Peter was too fast.

24
00:02:24.825 --> 00:02:36.280
He squeezed under the gate and ran home.

25
00:02:36.281 --> 00:02:40.966
Mrs. Rabbit scolded Peter. "Naughty rabbit!

26
00:02:40.967 --> 00:02:48.952
You lost your jacket and shoes!"

27
00:02:48.953 --> 00:02:54.344
The other bunnies ate bread and blackberries.

28
00:02:54.345 --> 00:02:57.281
But Peter didn't get any.

29
00:02:57.282 --> 00:03:10.079
Peter sneezed.

30
00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:19.294
Mrs. Rabbit gave him medicine.

31
00:03:19.295 --> 00:03:37.667
Then she sent him to bed.
